  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "Slice 2b real-interpreter proof demo (member/subordinate side): reads WorkingState.Commander (an Entity set by the host before ticking), passes it as the GetShared node's 'Target' pin to read the COORDINATOR entity's Entity-scoped 'rally' shared slot (SquadRallyState) cross-entity, mirrors RallyCount into WorkingState.RallyCountMirror via a pure FunctionCall + SetVariable, and mirrors the 'Found' flag into WorkingState.FoundMirror. Proves GetShared's optional Target pin compiles to BlueprintSharedState.TryGetShared<T>(world, <resolved target entity>, variableId, out value) instead of self, and that TryGetShared returns false (FoundMirror stays false, RallyCountMirror stays 0) when the coordinator hasn't provisioned the slot -- never throws.",
    "Category": null,
    "Recipe": null
  }
